<title>ESTONIA: FOREKSPANK SHAREHOLDER MEETING DETAILS.</title>
<headline>FOREKSPANK SHAREHOLDER MEETING DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forekspank, Estonia's sixth largest bank, said on Monday that it will hold its shareholder meeting on April 23 to vote on the banks profit distribution and the bank's plans for 1997.</p>
<p>Forekspank has opened a representative office in Moscow and has said that it wants to open a full branch but there was no indication whether these items would be on the agenda.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters</p>
